7}, {"x": 0.14847943906075292, "text": "Are there any mushrooms? I can't see them.", "w": 0.30948120117187494, "y": 0.7081395350926949, "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"h": 0.011440160007683409, "x": 0.09660107816940713, "text": "Peter: Mushrooms. Oh, no. I forgot.", "y": 0.7219900723364359, "w": 0.2576028611924913}, {"x": 0.09660109359092749, "w": 0.3738819037543402, "text": "Sian: And there isn't some / aren't some / isn't any", "y": 0.7359593027975548, "h": 0.012727520483065188}, {"x": 0.1465868176737307, "h": 0.01206773641737786, "y": 0.7507902595566694, "w": 0.07355266147189671, "text": "spaghetti."}, {"y": 0.7646816062925669, "x": 0.09651309468903435, "h": 0.010840275847094172, "w": 0.08067685445149739, "text": "Peter: Oh."}, {"x": 0.09481216939735355, "y": 0.7789169675420725, "text": "Sian: So, no spaghetti bolognese for us today. What", "w": 0.3828264702690972, "h": 0.012681869195256459}, {"y": 0.7941279070963697, "x": 0.14669052321729295, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "w": 0.08586761474609375, "text": "can we eat?"}, {"text": "Peter: *is there any / Are there some / Are there any", "w": 0.36493737114800345, "x": 0.09481216874919457, "y": 0.8079693138164231, "h": 0.012713825246487289}, {"text": "bread?", "x": 0.14653277182428465, "h": 0.010895671577660216, "y": 0.8228225132290081, "w": 0.048616032070583765}, {"y": 0.8371220931900786, "x": 0.09481216545973435, "text": "Sian:", "h": 0.010116278651819414, "w": 0.037567083570692286}, {"y": 0.8370216606658489, "w": 0.33273701985677084, "text": "Bread? I don't want a sandwich. I want dinner!", "x": 0.13953488345265233, "h": 0.010216711260351466}, {"text": "Peter: Well, there is some / are some / are any", "y": 0.8510319767946478, "w": 0.3363148328993055, "h": 0.012686434773331489, "x": 0.09481217090872532}, {"y": 0.034142442224507644, "h": 0.015325067077733063, "text": "* Complete the questions and short answers.", "w": 0.34704830593532987, "x": 0.5742397076047859}, {"text": "Woman: Can you make a shopping list and go s